<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42713" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρρωμένος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, pf.
		part.
		
			Pass.
		 of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥώννυμι</span>: generally used
		as Adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in good
				health,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				2.21
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρρωμένος ὤν,</span>
			opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσθενέστερος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				24.7
			</span></i> ; <i>powerful, influential, formidable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρρωμένη τέχνης δύναμις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phdr.</u>
					268a
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηχαναί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hero
					<u>Aut.</u>
					21.2
				</span></i>
			 (sed leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰρομένας</span>) :
			irreg. 
				Comp.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τειχομαχίη ἐρρωμενεστέρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					9.70
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ-έστεροι τῶν ἀνθρώπων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Grg.</u>
					483c
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρρωμενεστέραις ταῖς γνώμαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					3.3.31
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ φύσει</span></div>
